+## v0.8.8.4 ARM performance release
+
+`v0.8.8.4` extends the cached JIT-friendly execution path to ARM-heavy applications. The cache now distinguishes common ARM LDM/STM, word LDR/STR immediate/register forms, and hot ADD/MOV data-processing instructions, routing them through compact helpers while keeping the full decoder as the compatibility fallback.
+
